## Constructor of an or-pattern already matched by a previous case

```catala
declaration enumeration E:
  -- A
  -- B
  -- F

declaration scope S:
  context e content E
  output o content integer

scope S:
  definition e equals A
  definition o equals match e with pattern
    -- A: 0
    -- B or A: 1
    -- F: 2
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope S
┌─[ERROR]─
│
│  The constructor A has been matched twice.
│
├─➤ tests/enum/bad/or_pattern_already_matched.catala_en:17.13-14:
│    │
│ 17 │     -- B or A: 1
│    │             ‾
├─ Constructor of an or-pattern already matched by a previous case
│
├─➤ tests/enum/bad/or_pattern_already_matched.catala_en:16.8-9:
│    │
│ 16 │     -- A: 0
│    │        ‾
└─ Constructor of an or-pattern already matched by a previous case
#return code 123#
```
